  m_text: 'Whenever you move a card, if the new bottom card of that column is face-down,
    that card is flipped.


    <b>2. Filling Empty Columns</b>

    If you completely
    clear a Tableau column, you can move any card or same-suit sequence into that
    empty spot.'
