  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>3. Clearing Completed Sets</b>

    When you assemble a complete 13-card
    sequence of the same suit from King down to Ace, the entire stack is automatically
    removed from the Tableau.


    <b>4. Dealing from the Stock</b>

    As long
    as you have at least one card in every Tableau column, you may tap the Stock
    to deal up to 7 face-up cards into the Tableau (one per column). The final deal
    will only deal 3 cards.


    <b><size=+10>How To Win</size></b>

    You win
    the game when all cards have been cleared from the board.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6622473957194473056, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
