      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><size=+10>How To Play</size></b>

    <b>1. Building in the Tableau</b>

    Cards
    are stacked in descending order (from King to Ace), regardless of suit. For example,
    you can place a 7 of Hearts onto an 8 of Clubs. Additionally, you can move a
    group of cards together if they are all of the same suit and in descending sequence
    (such as a 9, 8, and 7 of Spades).'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6622473957194473056, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
