  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><size=+10>Objective</size></b>\nThe objective of Spiderette is to assemble
    4 complete same-suit sequences in descending order (from King down to Ace) within
    the Tableau. Once a full 13-card sequence of the same suit is completed, it is
    automatically removed from the board. \n\n<b><size=+10>Layout</size></b>\n<b>\\u2022
    Tableau:</b> The main playing area, consisting of 7 columns initially containing
    28 cards, with the bottom card of each column face up.\n<b>\\u2022 Stock:</b>
    The pile containing the remaining 24 cards, used to deal a new row of cards across
    all 7 Tableau columns."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
